 int waitForReply,                 2) Do the slave send us any value?\par
 unsigned int SpiData,             3) Data to be sent to the slave.\par
 spiDataSize  DataSize,            4) Data size or type    8, 12, 16\par
 int spi_frequency,                5) SPI channel frequency\par
 int spi_mode                      6) SPI Mode or SPI Format - default: put 0\par
 Variable_Name                     7) Variable will be used to save the results.\par
 DelayBetweenPackets               8) DelayBetweenPackets in uSec needs between each packet.\par
}
